{"error": {"message": "division by zero", "type": "execution_error"}, "ok": false, "tool": "run_python", "tool_use_id": "call_006"}
call_003 passed the string '101'; the executor received: query_db with customer_id coerced to an int

--- 2. Narrow coercion: what is repaired and what is rejected ---
integer  '42'      -> 42
