[{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"OpenAI Agents SDK: Handoffs, Guardrails and Tracing (Part 1 of 3)","textKn":"OpenAI Agents SDK: Handoffs, Guardrails ಮತ್ತು Tracing (ಭಾಗ 1 / 3)","level":"H1"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Lesson Info","headingKn":"Lesson ಮಾಹಿತಿ","bodyEn":"• Type: Build · Language: Python (stdlib only) · Time: ~60 minutes. Part 1 of 3: Agent, FunctionTool, Handoff, Runner and the hop limit. Every output below was genuinely produced by the lab file on Python 3.14.5. This is our own stdlib model of the ideas behind the OpenAI Agents SDK, not the SDK itself, and the model is a keyword stand-in, so no real LLM behaviour is measured. The pasted source was cut off inside choose_action, so the routing function and the final program are rebuilt. This lesson replaces the earlier lesson at this position.","bodyKn":"• Type: Build · ಭಾಷೆ: Python (stdlib ಮಾತ್ರ) · ಸಮಯ: ~60 ನಿಮಿಷ. ಮೂರು ಭಾಗಗಳಲ್ಲಿ 1ನೆಯದು: Agent, FunctionTool, Handoff, Runner ಮತ್ತು hop ಮಿತಿ. ಕೆಳಗಿನ ಎಲ್ಲಾ output ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ಫೈಲ್ ಮೂಲಕ Python 3.14.5 ನಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಪಡೆದದ್ದು. ಇದು OpenAI Agents SDK ಹಿಂದಿನ ಕಲ್ಪನೆಗಳ ನಮ್ಮದೇ stdlib ಮಾದರಿ, SDK ಸ್ವತಃ ಅಲ್ಲ, ಮತ್ತು ಮಾದರಿ ಕೀವರ್ಡ್ ಬದಲಿ, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ನಿಜವಾದ LLM ವರ್ತನೆ ಅಳೆಯಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿಲ್ಲ. ಅಂಟಿಸಿದ ಮೂಲ choose_action ಒಳಗೆ ಕತ್ತರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತ್ತು, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ರೂಟಿಂಗ್ ಕಾರ್ಯ ಮತ್ತು ಅಂತಿಮ ಪ್ರೋಗ್ರಾಂ ಮರುನಿರ್ಮಿತ. ಈ lesson ಈ ಸ್ಥಾನದ ಹಿಂದಿನ lesson ಅನ್ನು ಬದಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Delegation as a Tool-Like Action","textKn":"ಕ್ರಿಯೆಯಂತಹ ನಿಯೋಜನೆ","level":"H2"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Five Primitives","headingKn":"ಐದು ಮೂಲಭೂತ ಭಾಗಗಳು","bodyEn":"The lesson names five primitives: Agent (who works), Handoff (who takes over), Guardrail (is this allowed), Session (what happened before) and Tracing (what happened during the run). Part 1 builds the first two. An Agent bundles instructions, tools and handoffs. A Handoff points at another agent and is exposed to the model under a descriptive name, transfer_to_<agent_name>, so delegation fits the action-selection loop the model already uses for tools.","bodyKn":"ಲೆಸನ್ ಐದು ಮೂಲಭೂತ ಭಾಗಗಳನ್ನು ಹೆಸರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ: Agent (ಯಾರು ಕೆಲಸ ಮಾಡುತ್ತಾರೆ), Handoff (ಯಾರು ವಹಿಸಿಕೊಳ್ಳುತ್ತಾರೆ), Guardrail (ಇದಕ್ಕೆ ಅನುಮತಿ ಇದೆಯೇ), Session (ಮೊದಲು ಏನಾಯಿತು) ಮತ್ತು Tracing (ಓಟದ ವೇಳೆ ಏನಾಯಿತು). ಭಾಗ 1 ಮೊದಲ ಎರಡನ್ನು ನಿರ್ಮಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. Agent ಸೂಚನೆಗಳು, tools ಮತ್ತು handoffs ಕಟ್ಟುತ್ತದೆ. Handoff ಇನ್ನೊಂದು agent ಕಡೆ ತೋರಿಸಿ ಮಾದರಿಗೆ transfer_to_<agent_name> ಎಂಬ ವಿವರಣಾತ್ಮಕ ಹೆಸರಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಕಾಣುತ್ತದೆ, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ನಿಯೋಜನೆ ಮಾದರಿ ಈಗಾಗಲೇ tools ಗೆ ಬಳಸುವ ಕ್ರಿಯಾ-ಆಯ್ಕೆ ಚಕ್ರಕ್ಕೆ ಹೊಂದುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"diagram","data":{"headingEn":"Triage and Two Specialists","headingKn":"Triage ಮತ್ತು ಇಬ್ಬರು ತಜ್ಞರು","svgCode":"<svg viewBox="0 0 300 190" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="monospace" font-size="7"><rect width="300" height="190" rx="8" fill="#0f172a"/><text x="150" y="14" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle">Handoff: control moves to another agent</text><rect x="100" y="26" width="100" height="34" rx="5" fill="#1e1b4b" stroke="#a78bfa"/><text x="150" y="41" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">triage_agent</text><text x="150" y="53" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">chooses an action</text><rect x="15" y="110" width="110" height="34" rx="5" fill="#022c22" stroke="#34d399"/><text x="70" y="125" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">billing_agent</text><text x="70" y="137" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">transfer_to_billing_agent</text><rect x="175" y="110" width="110" height="34" rx="5" fill="#422006" stroke="#fbbf24"/><text x="230" y="125" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">support_agent</text><text x="230" y="137" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">transfer_to_support_agent</text><path d="M130,60 L70,110 M170,60 L230,110" stroke="#475569"/><text x="150" y="92" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">a handoff is a tool-like action</text><text x="150" y="180" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">a normal tool returns to the same agent; a handoff does not</text></svg>","captionEn":"Agents are nodes and handoffs are the transitions between them.","captionKn":"Agents ನೋಡ್‌ಗಳು ಮತ್ತು handoffs ಅವುಗಳ ನಡುವಿನ ಪರಿವರ್ತನೆಗಳು."}},{"type":"table","data":{"headingEn":"Tool call versus handoff","headingKn":"Tool ಕರೆ ಮತ್ತು handoff ಹೋಲಿಕೆ","headers":["","Function tool","Handoff"],"rows":[["After the call","Same agent continues","Another agent is active"],["What it does","Performs an operation","Transfers responsibility"],["Example","lookup_invoice","transfer_to_billing_agent"]]}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Building the Runtime","textKn":"Runtime ನಿರ್ಮಿಸುವುದು","level":"H2"}},{"type":"code","data":{"filename":"oai_1.py","headingEn":"FunctionTool, Agent, Handoff, choose_action and Runner","headingKn":"FunctionTool, Agent, Handoff, choose_action ಮತ್ತು Runner","descEn":"Handoff.tool_name is derived from the target name. choose_action is a keyword stand-in for the model so the runtime mechanics can be studied without an API. Runner.run loops: ask for an action, return on final, switch the active agent on handoff, and stop with an error once max_hops is exceeded.","descKn":"Handoff.tool_name ಗುರಿ ಹೆಸರಿನಿಂದ ಪಡೆಯಲಾಗುತ್ತದೆ. choose_action API ಇಲ್ಲದೆ runtime ಯಾಂತ್ರಿಕತೆ ಅಧ್ಯಯನ ಮಾಡಲು ಮಾದರಿಗೆ ಕೀವರ್ಡ್ ಬದಲಿ. Runner.run ಚಕ್ರ: ಕ್ರಿಯೆ ಕೇಳಿ, final ಆದರೆ ಹಿಂತಿರುಗಿ, handoff ಆದರೆ ಸಕ್ರಿಯ agent ಬದಲಿಸಿ, max_hops ಮೀರಿದರೆ ದೋಷದೊಂದಿಗೆ ನಿಲ್ಲುತ್ತದೆ.","code":"@dataclass
class FunctionTool:
    name: str
    description: str
    function: Callable[..., Any]

    def invoke(self, **kwargs):
        return self.function(**kwargs)


@dataclass
class Agent:
    name: str
    instructions: str
    tools: list = field(default_factory=list)
    handoffs: list = field(default_factory=list)


@dataclass
class Handoff:
    target_agent: Agent

    @property
    def tool_name(self):
        return f"transfer_to_{self.target_agent.name}"


BILLING_WORDS = ["billing", "charged", "payment", "invoice", "refund"]
SUPPORT_WORDS = ["error", "crash", "bug", "technical", "broken"]


def choose_action(agent, user_input):
    """Simulated model: keyword routing so the runtime mechanics can be studied without an API."""
    text = user_input.lower()
    if agent.name == "triage_agent":
        if any(w in text for w in BILLING_WORDS):
            return {"type": "handoff", "name": "transfer_to_billing_agent"}
        if any(w in text for w in SUPPORT_WORDS):
            return {"type": "handoff", "name": "transfer_to_support_agent"}
        return {"type": "final", "content": "I can help route your request."}
    if agent.name == "billing_agent":
        return {"type": "final", "content": "Billing agent: I'll help investigate the billing issue."}
    if agent.name == "support_agent":
        return {"type": "final", "content": "Support agent: I'll help troubleshoot the technical issue."}
    if agent.name == "ping_agent":
        return {"type": "handoff", "name": "transfer_to_pong_agent"}
    if agent.name == "pong_agent":
        return {"type": "handoff", "name": "transfer_to_ping_agent"}
    raise RuntimeError(f"no policy for {agent.name}")


class Runner:
    def __init__(self, max_hops=4):
        self.max_hops = max_hops
        self.path = []

    def resolve_handoff(self, agent, tool_name):
        for handoff in agent.handoffs:
            if handoff.tool_name == tool_name:
                return handoff.target_agent
        raise RuntimeError(f"Unknown handoff: {tool_name}")

    def run(self, agent, user_input):
        current, hops = agent, 0
        self.path = [agent.name]
        while True:
            action = choose_action(current, user_input)
            if action["type"] == "final":
                return action["content"]
            if action["type"] == "handoff":
                hops += 1
                if self.max_hops is not None and hops > self.max_hops:
                    raise RuntimeError("Maximum handoff count exceeded")
                current = self.resolve_handoff(current, action["name"])
                self.path.append(current.name)"}},{"type":"code","data":{"filename":"oai_1.py","headingEn":"main(): six experiments","headingKn":"main(): ಆರು ಪ್ರಯೋಗಗಳು","descEn":"main() routes three requests, lists handoff names, probes keyword routing on mixed and indirect requests, tests context across turns, bounds a ping-pong cycle with and without a hop limit, and contrasts tool and handoff.","descKn":"main() ಮೂರು ವಿನಂತಿ ರೂಟ್ ಮಾಡುತ್ತದೆ, handoff ಹೆಸರುಗಳ ಪಟ್ಟಿ ಮಾಡುತ್ತದೆ, ಮಿಶ್ರ ಮತ್ತು ಪರೋಕ್ಷ ವಿನಂತಿಗಳ ಮೇಲೆ ಕೀವರ್ಡ್ ರೂಟಿಂಗ್ ಪರೀಕ್ಷಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ತಿರುವುಗಳಾದ್ಯಂತ context ಪರೀಕ್ಷಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, hop ಮಿತಿ ಇದ್ದು ಮತ್ತು ಇಲ್ಲದೆ ping-pong ಚಕ್ರ ಮಿತಿಗೊಳಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಮತ್ತು tool ಹಾಗೂ handoff ಹೋಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ.","code":"billing_agent = Agent("billing_agent", "Handle billing, invoice, payment, refund and subscription issues.")
support_agent = Agent("support_agent", "Handle technical support, bugs, errors, crashes and troubleshooting.")
triage_agent = Agent("triage_agent", "Determine whether the user needs billing or technical support.")
triage_agent.handoffs = [Handoff(billing_agent), Handoff(support_agent)]
ping_agent, pong_agent = Agent("ping_agent", "p"), Agent("pong_agent", "q")
ping_agent.handoffs, pong_agent.handoffs = [Handoff(pong_agent)], [Handoff(ping_agent)]


def section(t):
    print(f"\n--- {t} ---")


def main():
    section("1. Triage routes to a specialist through a tool-like handoff")
    for text in ("I was charged twice.", "The application crashes on startup.", "Hello there"):
        runner = Runner()
        out = runner.run(triage_agent, text)
        print(f"{text!r:42} path={runner.path} | {out}")

    section("2. Handoffs are named tools")
    print([h.tool_name for h in triage_agent.handoffs])
    try:
        Runner().resolve_handoff(billing_agent, "transfer_to_support_agent")
    except RuntimeError as e:
        print("billing_agent has no handoffs, so resolving one ->", e)

    section("3. Genuinely checking: keyword routing on mixed and indirect requests")
    cases = [
        "I was charged twice and the app also crashes",
        "I was double billed last month",
        "My card was declined at checkout",
        "Do you offer a crash course on invoices?",
        "The refund button is broken",
        "Can you help me with my subscription?",
    ]
    for text in cases:
        r = Runner()
        out = r.run(triage_agent, text)
        print(f"{text!r:48} -> {r.path[-1]}")
    print("mixed requests go to whichever keyword list is checked first; paraphrases ('double billed', 'declined', 'subscription') fall through unrouted, and 'crash course on invoices' went to billing only because that list is checked first")
    r = Runner()
    r.run(triage_agent, "Do you offer a crash course for new users?")
    print("'Do you offer a crash course for new users?' ->", r.path[-1], "(a plain substring match on 'crash' treats a sales question as a technical fault)")

    section("4. Genuinely checking: a handoff carries only what the runner passes")
    r = Runner()
    print("turn 1:", r.run(triage_agent, "I was charged twice for Pro yesterday."), r.path)
    r = Runner()
    print("turn 2:", r.run(triage_agent, "It happened yesterday."), r.path)
    print("the second turn is routed on its own text only; the earlier billing context was not carried, so triage could not route it")

    section("5. Genuinely checking: a handoff cycle needs a hop limit")
    r = Runner(max_hops=4)
    try:
        r.run(ping_agent, "anything")
    except RuntimeError as e:
        print("RuntimeError:", e, "| path:", r.path)

    class Counting(Runner):
        def resolve_handoff(self, agent, tool_name):
            self.calls = getattr(self, "calls", 0) + 1
            if self.calls >= 5000:
                raise KeyboardInterrupt("test harness stopped an unbounded loop")
            return super().resolve_handoff(agent, tool_name)
    r = Counting(max_hops=None)
    try:
        r.run(ping_agent, "anything")
    except KeyboardInterrupt as e:
        print("with no hop limit:", e, "after", r.calls, "handoffs")

    section("6. Tool call versus handoff: who is active afterwards")
    lookups = []
    invoice = FunctionTool("lookup_invoice", "Look up an invoice", lambda invoice_id: lookups.append(invoice_id) or f"invoice {invoice_id}: paid")
    active = "billing_agent"
    print("before tool call, active agent:", active, "| result:", invoice.invoke(invoice_id="A-1"), "| active after tool:", active)
    r = Runner()
    r.run(triage_agent, "refund please")
    print("before handoff, active agent: triage_agent | active after handoff:", r.path[-1])"}},{"type":"output","data":{"output":"
