[{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"OpenAI Agents SDK: Handoffs, Guardrails and Tracing (Part 2 of 3)","textKn":"OpenAI Agents SDK: Handoffs, Guardrails ಮತ್ತು Tracing (ಭಾಗ 2 / 3)","level":"H1"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Lesson Info","headingKn":"Lesson ಮಾಹಿತಿ","bodyEn":"• Type: Build · Language: Python (stdlib only) · Time: ~60 minutes. Part 2 of 3: input, output and tool guardrails, tripwires and parallel versus blocking scheduling. Every output below was genuinely produced by the lab file on Python 3.14.5. This is our own stdlib model of the ideas behind the OpenAI Agents SDK, not the SDK itself, and the model is a keyword stand-in, so no real LLM behaviour is measured. The pasted full program was cut off, so it is rebuilt. The parallel-versus-blocking timings use real threads and sleeps standing in for model and guardrail latency. This lesson replaces the earlier lesson at this position.","bodyKn":"• Type: Build · ಭಾಷೆ: Python (stdlib ಮಾತ್ರ) · ಸಮಯ: ~60 ನಿಮಿಷ. ಮೂರು ಭಾಗಗಳಲ್ಲಿ 2ನೆಯದು: input, output ಮತ್ತು tool guardrails, tripwires ಮತ್ತು parallel ವರ್ಸಸ್ blocking ವೇಳಾಪಟ್ಟಿ. ಕೆಳಗಿನ ಎಲ್ಲಾ output ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ಫೈಲ್ ಮೂಲಕ Python 3.14.5 ನಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಪಡೆದದ್ದು. ಇದು OpenAI Agents SDK ಹಿಂದಿನ ಕಲ್ಪನೆಗಳ ನಮ್ಮದೇ stdlib ಮಾದರಿ, SDK ಸ್ವತಃ ಅಲ್ಲ, ಮತ್ತು ಮಾದರಿ ಕೀವರ್ಡ್ ಬದಲಿ, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ನಿಜವಾದ LLM ವರ್ತನೆ ಅಳೆಯಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿಲ್ಲ. ಅಂಟಿಸಿದ ಸಂಪೂರ್ಣ ಪ್ರೋಗ್ರಾಂ ಕತ್ತರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತ್ತು, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ಅದನ್ನು ಮರುನಿರ್ಮಿಸಲಾಗಿದೆ. Parallel-ವರ್ಸಸ್-blocking ಸಮಯಗಳು ಮಾದರಿ ಮತ್ತು guardrail ವಿಳಂಬದ ಬದಲು ನಿಜವಾದ threads ಮತ್ತು sleeps ಬಳಸುತ್ತವೆ. ಈ lesson ಈ ಸ್ಥಾನದ ಹಿಂದಿನ lesson ಅನ್ನು ಬದಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Guarding the Boundaries","textKn":"ಗಡಿಗಳನ್ನು ಕಾಯುವುದು","level":"H2"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Detection Is Not Enforcement","headingKn":"ಪತ್ತೆ ಜಾರಿ ಅಲ್ಲ","bodyEn":"A guardrail is a validation layer at a boundary. It returns a GuardrailResult, a plain judgement with a tripwire flag and a reason. The runner turns a tripped result into an exception, which stops normal execution. Separating the judgement from the reaction keeps policy reusable. Three boundaries matter: input (before the run enters the loop), tool (around each function-tool call) and output (before the final answer leaves). Each guardrail sees only the data available at its own boundary.","bodyKn":"Guardrail ಒಂದು ಗಡಿಯಲ್ಲಿನ ಮಾನ್ಯತಾ ಪದರ. ಅದು GuardrailResult ಹಿಂತಿರುಗಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಅದು tripwire ಧ್ವಜ ಮತ್ತು ಕಾರಣ ಇರುವ ಸರಳ ತೀರ್ಮಾನ. Runner ಪ್ರಚೋದಿತ ಫಲಿತಾಂಶವನ್ನು ವಿನಾಯಿತಿಯಾಗಿ ಬದಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಅದು ಸಾಮಾನ್ಯ ಚಲಾವಣೆ ನಿಲ್ಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. ತೀರ್ಮಾನ ಮತ್ತು ಪ್ರತಿಕ್ರಿಯೆ ಬೇರ್ಪಡಿಸುವುದು ನೀತಿಯನ್ನು ಮರುಬಳಕೆಗೆ ಯೋಗ್ಯವಾಗಿಡುತ್ತದೆ. ಮೂರು ಗಡಿಗಳು ಮುಖ್ಯ: input (ಓಟ ಚಕ್ರ ಪ್ರವೇಶಿಸುವ ಮೊದಲು), tool (ಪ್ರತಿ function-tool ಕರೆಯ ಸುತ್ತ) ಮತ್ತು output (ಅಂತಿಮ ಉತ್ತರ ಹೊರಹೋಗುವ ಮೊದಲು). ಪ್ರತಿ guardrail ತನ್ನ ಗಡಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಲಭ್ಯವಿರುವ ದತ್ತಾಂಶ ಮಾತ್ರ ನೋಡುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"diagram","data":{"headingEn":"Input, Tool and Output Guardrails","headingKn":"Input, Tool ಮತ್ತು Output Guardrails","svgCode":"<svg viewBox="0 0 300 190" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="monospace" font-size="7"><rect width="300" height="190" rx="8" fill="#0f172a"/><text x="150" y="14" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle">Three guardrail boundaries</text><rect x="10" y="40" width="80" height="34" rx="5" fill="#450a0a" stroke="#f87171"/><text x="50" y="55" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">INPUT</text><text x="50" y="67" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">before the loop</text><rect x="110" y="40" width="80" height="34" rx="5" fill="#022c22" stroke="#34d399"/><text x="150" y="55" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">AGENT</text><text x="150" y="67" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">handoffs inside</text><rect x="210" y="40" width="80" height="34" rx="5" fill="#450a0a" stroke="#f87171"/><text x="250" y="55" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">OUTPUT</text><text x="250" y="67" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">final answer only</text><path d="M90,57 H110 M190,57 H210" stroke="#475569"/><rect x="110" y="110" width="80" height="34" rx="5" fill="#450a0a" stroke="#f87171"/><text x="150" y="125" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">TOOL</text><text x="150" y="137" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">around each call</text><path d="M150,74 V110" stroke="#475569"/><text x="150" y="180" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">each guardrail guards only the boundary it is attached to</text></svg>","captionEn":"Each guardrail guards the boundary it is attached to and nothing else.","captionKn":"ಪ್ರತಿ guardrail ತಾನು ಜೋಡಿಸಿದ ಗಡಿಯನ್ನು ಮಾತ್ರ ಕಾಯುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"table","data":{"headingEn":"Blocking versus parallel guardrails","headingKn":"Blocking ವರ್ಸಸ್ parallel guardrails","headers":["","Blocking","Parallel"],"rows":[["Order","Guardrail, then main work","Both start together"],["Allowed request","Pays guardrail latency","Hides guardrail latency"],["Rejected request","Main work never starts","Main work already started"]]}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Building the Guarded Runtime","textKn":"ರಕ್ಷಿತ Runtime ನಿರ್ಮಿಸುವುದು","level":"H2"}},{"type":"code","data":{"filename":"oai_2.py","headingEn":"Tripwires, GuardrailResult, guarded tools and the Runner","headingKn":"Tripwires, GuardrailResult, ರಕ್ಷಿತ tools ಮತ್ತು Runner","descEn":"Three exception types name the three boundaries. FunctionTool.invoke runs its guardrails before the function. refund_guardrail rejects non-positive amounts and anything over 500. The Runner runs input guardrails once before the loop and output guardrails on the final answer; the tool branch returns its result directly.","descKn":"ಮೂರು ವಿನಾಯಿತಿ ಬಗೆಗಳು ಮೂರು ಗಡಿಗಳನ್ನು ಹೆಸರಿಸುತ್ತವೆ. FunctionTool.invoke ಕಾರ್ಯಕ್ಕೆ ಮೊದಲು ತನ್ನ guardrails ಚಲಾಯಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. refund_guardrail ಧನಾತ್ಮಕವಲ್ಲದ ಮೊತ್ತ ಮತ್ತು 500 ಮೀರಿದ್ದನ್ನು ತಿರಸ್ಕರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. Runner input guardrails ಅನ್ನು ಚಕ್ರಕ್ಕೆ ಮೊದಲು ಒಮ್ಮೆ ಮತ್ತು output guardrails ಅನ್ನು ಅಂತಿಮ ಉತ್ತರದ ಮೇಲೆ ಚಲಾಯಿಸುತ್ತದೆ; tool ಶಾಖೆ ತನ್ನ ಫಲಿತಾಂಶ ನೇರವಾಗಿ ಹಿಂತಿರುಗಿಸುತ್ತದೆ.","code":"class InputGuardrailTripwireTriggered(Exception):
    pass


class OutputGuardrailTripwireTriggered(Exception):
    pass


class ToolGuardrailTripwireTriggered(Exception):
    pass


@dataclass
class GuardrailResult:
    tripwire_triggered: bool
    reason: str


@dataclass
class FunctionTool:
    name: str
    description: str
    function: Callable[..., Any]
    guardrails: list = field(default_factory=list)

    def invoke(self, **kwargs):
        for guardrail in self.guardrails:
            result = guardrail(kwargs)
            if result.tripwire_triggered:
                raise ToolGuardrailTripwireTriggered(result.reason)
        return self.function(**kwargs)


@dataclass
class Handoff:
    target_agent: "Agent"

    @property
    def tool_name(self):
        return f"transfer_to_{self.target_agent.name}"


@dataclass
class Agent:
    name: str
    instructions: str
    tools: list = field(default_factory=list)
    handoffs: list = field(default_factory=list)
    input_guardrails: list = field(default_factory=list)
    output_guardrails: list = field(default_factory=list)


def sensitive_input_guardrail(text):
    for term in ("password", "secret key", "api key"):
        if term in text.lower():
            return GuardrailResult(True, f"Sensitive input detected: {term}")
    return GuardrailResult(False, "Input accepted")


def sensitive_output_guardrail(text):
    for term in ("internal secret", "private token", "customer password"):
        if term in text.lower():
            return GuardrailResult(True, f"Sensitive output detected: {term}")
    return GuardrailResult(False, "Output accepted")


REFUND_CALLS = []


def issue_refund(amount):
    REFUND_CALLS.append(amount)
    return f"Refund approved for ${amount:.2f}"


def refund_guardrail(arguments):
    amount = arguments.get("amount", 0)
    if amount <= 0:
        return GuardrailResult(True, "Refund amount must be positive")
    if amount > 500:
        return GuardrailResult(True, "Automatic refunds cannot exceed $500")
    return GuardrailResult(False, "Refund allowed")


refund_tool = FunctionTool("issue_refund", "Issue an approved customer refund.", issue_refund, [refund_guardrail])


def choose_action(agent, user_input):
    text = user_input.lower()
    if agent.name == "triage_agent":
        if any(w in text for w in BILLING_WORDS):
            return {"type": "handoff", "name": "transfer_to_billing_agent"}
        if any(w in text for w in SUPPORT_WORDS):
            return {"type": "handoff", "name": "transfer_to_support_agent"}
        return {"type": "final", "content": "I can help route your request."}
    if agent.name == "billing_agent":
        if "refund" in text:
            return {"type": "tool", "name": "issue_refund", "arguments": {"amount": 120.0}}
        return {"type": "final", "content": "Billing agent: I'll investigate the billing issue."}
    if agent.name == "support_agent":
        return {"type": "final", "content": "Support agent: I'll troubleshoot the technical issue."}
    if agent.name == "leaky_agent":
        return {"type": "tool", "name": "dump_notes", "arguments": {}}
    raise RuntimeError(agent.name)


class Runner:
    def __init__(self, max_hops=4):
        self.max_hops = max_hops
        self.entered = []

    def run_input_guardrails(self, agent, text):
        for g in agent.input_guardrails:
            result = g(text)
            if result.tripwire_triggered:
                raise InputGuardrailTripwireTriggered(result.reason)

    def run_output_guardrails(self, agent, output):
        for g in agent.output_guardrails:
            result = g(output)
            if result.tripwire_triggered:
                raise OutputGuardrailTripwireTriggered(result.reason)

    def run(self, agent, user_input):
        current, hops = agent, 0
        self.entered = [agent.name]
        self.run_input_guardrails(current, user_input)
        while True:
            action = choose_action(current, user_input)
            if action["type"] == "final":
                output = action["content"]
                self.run_output_guardrails(current, output)
                return output
            if action["type"] == "handoff":
                hops += 1
                if hops > self.max_hops:
                    raise RuntimeError("Maximum handoff count exceeded")
                current = next(h.target_agent for h in current.handoffs if h.tool_name == action["name"])
                self.entered.append(current.name)
            if action["type"] == "tool":
                tool = next(t for t in current.tools if t.name == action["name"])
                return tool.invoke(**action["arguments"])


billing = Agent("billing_agent", "billing", tools=[refund_tool])
support = Agent("support_agent", "support")
triage = Agent("triage_agent", "route", handoffs=[Handoff(billing), Handoff(support)],
               input_guardrails=[sensitive_input_guardrail], output_guardrails=[sensitive_output_guardrail])"}},{"type":"code","data":{"filename":"oai_2.py","headingEn":"main(): six experiments and the timing harness","headingKn":"main(): ಆರು ಪ್ರಯೋಗಗಳು ಮತ್ತು ಸಮಯ ಹಾರ್ನೆಸ್","descEn":"timed_run uses real threads: a guardrail thread and a model thread that cannot be cancelled once started. main() runs the four scenarios, probes refund amounts and unanticipated values, probes the keyword input guardrail, checks where guardrails actually run, and measures the scheduling modes.","descKn":"timed_run ನಿಜವಾದ threads ಬಳಸುತ್ತದೆ: guardrail thread ಮತ್ತು ಪ್ರಾರಂಭವಾದ ನಂತರ ರದ್ದುಪಡಿಸಲಾಗದ ಮಾದರಿ thread. main() ನಾಲ್ಕು ಸನ್ನಿವೇಶ ಚಲಾಯಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಮರುಪಾವತಿ ಮೊತ್ತಗಳು ಮತ್ತು ನಿರೀಕ್ಷಿಸದ ಮೌಲ್ಯಗಳನ್ನು ಪರೀಕ್ಷಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಕೀವರ್ಡ್ input guardrail ಪರೀಕ್ಷಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, guardrails ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಎಲ್ಲಿ ಚಲಿಸುತ್ತವೆ ಎಂದು ಪರಿಶೀಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಮತ್ತು ವೇಳಾಪಟ್ಟಿ ವಿಧಾನಗಳನ್ನು ಅಳೆಯುತ್ತದೆ.","code":"def section(t):
    print(f"\n--- {t} ---")


def attempt(label, fn):
    try:
        print(f"{label}: {fn()}")
    except Exception as e:
        print(f"{label}: {type(e).__name__}: {e}")


def timed_run(guardrail_s, model_s, trips, parallel):
    """Real threads. The 'model' cannot be cancelled once started, as with a real request in flight."""
    state = {"model_started": False, "model_done": False}
    verdict = {}

    def guard():
        time.sleep(guardrail_s)
        verdict["trip"] = trips

    def model():
        state["model_started"] = True
        time.sleep(model_s)
        state["model_done"] = True

    t0 = time.perf_counter()
    if parallel:
        g, m = threading.Thread(target=guard), threading.Thread(target=model)
        g.start(); m.start(); g.join()
        decided = time.perf_counter() - t0
        if verdict["trip"]:
            elapsed = decided
        else:
            m.join()
            elapsed = time.perf_counter() - t0
        m.join()
        wasted = model_s if state["model_started"] and verdict["trip"] else 0.0
    else:
        guard()
        if verdict["trip"]:
            elapsed, wasted = time.perf_counter() - t0, 0.0
        else:
            model()
            elapsed, wasted = time.perf_counter() - t0, 0.0
    return elapsed, state["model_started"], wasted


def main():
    section("1. The four scenarios from the lesson")
    for text in ("I was charged twice.", "The application crashes on startup.", "I want a refund.", "My password is abc123 and billing is broken."):
        r = Runner()
        attempt(f"{text!r:46}", lambda: (r.run(triage, text), r.entered)[0] if False else f"{r.run(triage, text)} | entered {r.entered}")

    section("2. Genuinely checking the refund tool guardrail")
    REFUND_CALLS.clear()
    for amount in (120, 5000, 0, -5, 500, 500.01):
        attempt(f"amount={amount!r:7}", lambda a=amount: refund_tool.invoke(amount=a))
    print("refund function was executed for amounts:", REFUND_CALLS)
    print("5000 never reached issue_refund; the boundary 500 is allowed and 500.01 is blocked")

    section("3. Genuinely checking values the policy did not anticipate")
    REFUND_CALLS.clear()
    for label, amount in (("nan", float("nan")), ("True", True), ("'120' (string)", "120"), ("inf", float("inf"))):
        attempt(f"amount={label:15}", lambda a=amount: refund_tool.invoke(amount=a))
    print("function ran for:", REFUND_CALLS)
    print("NaN fails both comparisons (nan <= 0 and nan > 500 are False) so it is approved; the string raised TypeError inside the guardrail instead of tripping it")

    section("4. Genuinely checking the keyword input guardrail")
    for text in ("my password is hunter2", "my PASSWORD is hunter2", "my p4ssword is hunter2", "my pass word is hunter2",
                 "my pwd is hunter2", "here is my api-key: sk-123", "here is my API key: sk-123"):
        res = sensitive_input_guardrail(text)
        print(f"{text!r:34} tripped={res.tripwire_triggered}")
    print("case changes are caught; leetspeak, spacing, abbreviations and punctuation variants all pass")

    section("5. Genuinely checking where each guardrail actually runs")
    guarded_specialist = Agent("billing_agent", "billing", tools=[refund_tool],
                               input_guardrails=[lambda t: GuardrailResult(True, "specialist input guard fired")])
    t2 = Agent("triage_agent", "route", handoffs=[Handoff(guarded_specialist), Handoff(support)])
    attempt("specialist's own input guardrail after a handoff", lambda: Runner().run(t2, "I was charged twice."))
    print("it never fired: input guardrails run once, on the starting agent, before the loop")

    leaky = Agent("leaky_agent", "leaks", tools=[FunctionTool("dump_notes", "dump", lambda: "customer password: hunter2")],
                  output_guardrails=[sensitive_output_guardrail])
    attempt("tool result containing 'customer password'", lambda: Runner().run(leaky, "anything"))
    print("the output guardrail never saw it: the tool path returns the result directly, bypassing the final-output check")

    section("6. Genuinely measuring blocking versus parallel guardrails (real threads, seconds)")
    g, m = 0.2, 0.6
    print(f"guardrail takes {g}s, 'model' takes {m}s")
    print(f"{'mode':10} {'request':8} {'wall time':>10} {'model started':>14} {'model work discarded':>22}")
    for parallel in (False, True):
        for trips in (False, True):
            elapsed, started, wasted = timed_run(g, m, trips, parallel)
            print(f"{'parallel' if parallel else 'blocking':10} {'rejected' if trips else 'allowed':8} {elapsed:>9.2f}s {str(started):>14} {wasted:>21.1f}s")
    print("allowed request: parallel saves about the guardrail time; rejected request: both return at ~0.2s but parallel had already started the model")"}},{"type":"output","data":{"output":"
