hat happened to the violating run?","qKn":"ಉಲ್ಲಂಘನೆ ಓಟಕ್ಕೆ ಏನಾಯಿತು?","opts":["Release was allowed","Release was blocked by a block-severity failure","It was ignored","It crashed"],"optsKn":["Release ಅನುಮತಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು","Block-ತೀವ್ರತೆಯ ವೈಫಲ್ಯದಿಂದ release ತಡೆಯಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು","ನಿರ್ಲಕ್ಷಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು","ಕ್ರ್ಯಾಶ್ ಆಯಿತು"],"correct":1},{"q":"What did an empty run record produce for the tests rule?","qKn":"ಖಾಲಿ ಓಟ ದಾಖಲೆ tests ನಿಯಮಕ್ಕೆ ಏನು ನೀಡಿತು?","opts":["pass","fail","unknown","error"],"optsKn":["pass","fail","unknown","error"],"correct":2},{"q":"Why did a 90 percent score still block release?","qKn":"90 ಶೇಕಡಾ ಅಂಕ ಇನ್ನೂ release ಏಕೆ ತಡೆಯಿತು?","opts":["The failed rule had block severity","The score was too low","It had no score","The parser failed"],"optsKn":["ವಿಫಲ ನಿಯಮ block ತೀವ್ರತೆಯದ್ದಾಗಿತ್ತು","ಅಂಕ ತುಂಬಾ ಕಡಿಮೆ","ಅದಕ್ಕೆ ಅಂಕ ಇರಲಿಲ್ಲ","Parser ವಿಫಲವಾಯಿತು"],"correct":0},{"q":"What did a rule naming a nonexistent checker evaluate to?","qKn":"ಅಸ್ತಿತ್ವದಲ್ಲಿಲ್ಲದ checker ಹೆಸರಿಸಿದ ನಿಯಮ ಯಾವುದಕ್ಕೆ ಮೌಲ್ಯಮಾಪನವಾಯಿತು?","opts":["pass","error","skip","warn"],"optsKn":["pass","error","skip","warn"],"correct":1},{"q":"How many malformed rule files did the parser refuse?","qKn":"Parser ಎಷ್ಟು ತಪ್ಪಾದ ನಿಯಮ ಫೈಲ್‌ಗಳನ್ನು ತಿರಸ್ಕರಿಸಿತು?","opts":["0","2","4","5"],"optsKn":["0","2","4","5"],"correct":2}]}}]

