th paths and True was refused as an integer. 2) An unanchored pattern accepted "T-014 extra". 3) A nested board error was located by path. 4) Duplicates, ghost references and unknown fields passed. 5) An empty next_action passed.","bodyKn":"1) ಎಲ್ಲಾ 9 ಅಮಾನ್ಯ ಸ್ಥಿತಿಗಳು path ಜೊತೆ ತಿರಸ್ಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟವು ಮತ್ತು True ಅನ್ನು integer ಎಂದು ತಿರಸ್ಕರಿಸಲಾಯಿತು. 2) Unanchored ಮಾದರಿ "T-014 extra" ಸ್ವೀಕರಿಸಿತು. 3) ನೆಸ್ಟೆಡ್ board ದೋಷ path ಮೂಲಕ ಪತ್ತೆಯಾಯಿತು. 4) ನಕಲುಗಳು, ಭೂತ ಉಲ್ಲೇಖಗಳು ಮತ್ತು ಅಜ್ಞಾತ ಕ್ಷೇತ್ರಗಳು ಪಾಸ್ ಆದವು. 5) ಖಾಲಿ next_action ಪಾಸ್ ಆಯಿತು."}},{"type":"quiz","data":{"questions":[{"q":"Why was True refused as a schema_version?","qKn":"schema_version ಆಗಿ True ಏಕೆ ತಿರಸ್ಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು?","opts":["bool is a subclass of int and the validator excludes it","True is negative","It was missing","It was too long"],"optsKn":["bool int ನ ಉಪವರ್ಗ ಮತ್ತು validator ಅದನ್ನು ಹೊರಗಿಡುತ್ತದೆ","True ಋಣಾತ್ಮಕ","ಅದು ಕಾಣೆಯಾಗಿತ್ತು","ಅದು ತುಂಬಾ ಉದ್ದ"],"correct":0},{"q":"Which strings did the unanchored pattern wrongly accept?","qKn":"Unanchored ಮಾದರಿ ಯಾವ ಸ್ಟ್ರಿಂಗ್‌ಗಳನ್ನು ತಪ್ಪಾಗಿ ಸ್ವೀಕರಿಸಿತು?","opts":["xT-001y and T-014 extra","T-01 and T-ABC","TASK-125 only","None"],"optsKn":["xT-001y ಮತ್ತು T-014 extra","T-01 ಮತ್ತು T-ABC","TASK-125 ಮಾತ್ರ","ಯಾವುದೂ ಇಲ್ಲ"],"correct":0},{"q":"Which problem did the structural check miss?","qKn":"ರಚನಾತ್ಮಕ ಪರಿಶೀಲನೆ ಯಾವ ಸಮಸ್ಯೆ ತಪ್ಪಿಸಿತು?","opts":["A null array","Duplicate task ids","A wrong type","A bad enum value"],"optsKn":["null ಅರೆ","ನಕಲು task ids","ತಪ್ಪು type","ತಪ್ಪು enum ಮೌಲ್ಯ"],"correct":1},{"q":"How many errors did the three-task board produce?","qKn":"ಮೂರು-ಕಾರ್ಯದ board ಎಷ್ಟು ದೋಷ ನೀಡಿತು?","opts":["0","1","3","9"],"optsKn":["0","1","3","9"],"correct":2},{"q":"Did a document with an empty next_action pass the schema?","qKn":"ಖಾಲಿ next_action ಇರುವ ದಾಖಲೆ schema ಪಾಸ್ ಮಾಡಿತೇ?","opts":["Yes, so usefulness needs a separate rule","No, it was refused","It crashed","It was ignored"],"optsKn":["ಹೌದು, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ಉಪಯುಕ್ತತೆಗೆ ಪ್ರತ್ಯೇಕ ನಿಯಮ ಬೇಕು","ಇಲ್ಲ, ತಿರಸ್ಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು","ಕ್ರ್ಯಾಶ್ ಆಯಿತು","ನಿರ್ಲಕ್ಷಿಸಲ್