[{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Initialization Scripts for Agents (Part 1 of 3)","textKn":"Agents ಗಾಗಿ ಆರಂಭ ಸ್ಕ್ರಿಪ್ಟ್‌ಗಳು (ಭಾಗ 1 / 3)","level":"H1"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Lesson Info","headingKn":"Lesson ಮಾಹಿತಿ","bodyEn":"• Type: Build · Language: Python (stdlib only) · Time: ~60 minutes. Part 1 of 3: five readiness probes, a JSON report, a real exit code and idempotency. Every output below was genuinely produced by the lab file on Python 3.14.5. This is our own stdlib model of the ideas behind initialization scripts for agents (readiness probes, reports, gates and anchors), not the real software, and the probes run against this machine and a temporary git repository and no language model is involved, so no real LLM behaviour is measured. The pasted lesson said its original main.py was not supplied, so the lab is our own implementation of the behaviour it describes; results depend on the machine it ran on. This lesson replaces the earlier lesson at this position.","bodyKn":"• Type: Build · ಭಾಷೆ: Python (stdlib ಮಾತ್ರ) · ಸಮಯ: ~60 ನಿಮಿಷ. ಮೂರು ಭಾಗಗಳಲ್ಲಿ 1ನೆಯದು: ಐದು ಸಿದ್ಧತೆ probes, JSON ವರದಿ, ನಿಜ exit code ಮತ್ತು idempotency. ಕೆಳಗಿನ ಎಲ್ಲಾ output ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ಫೈಲ್ ಮೂಲಕ Python 3.14.5 ನಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಪಡೆದದ್ದು. ಇದು agents ಗಾಗಿ ಆರಂಭ ಸ್ಕ್ರಿಪ್ಟ್‌ಗಳು (ಸಿದ್ಧತೆ probes, ವರದಿಗಳು, gates ಮತ್ತು anchors) ಹಿಂದಿನ ಕಲ್ಪನೆಗಳ ನಮ್ಮದೇ stdlib ಮಾದರಿ, ನಿಜವಾದ ಸಾಫ್ಟ್‌ವೇರ್ ಅಲ್ಲ, ಮತ್ತು probes ಈ ಯಂತ್ರ ಮತ್ತು ತಾತ್ಕಾಲಿಕ git repository ಮೇಲೆ ಓಡುತ್ತವೆ ಮತ್ತು ಯಾವುದೇ ಭಾಷಾ ಮಾದರಿ ಇಲ್ಲ, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ನಿಜವಾದ LLM ವರ್ತನೆ ಅಳೆಯಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿಲ್ಲ. ಅಂಟಿಸಿದ lesson ತನ್ನ ಮೂಲ main.py ಒದಗಿಸಿಲ್ಲ ಎಂದು ಹೇಳಿತ್ತು, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ಅದು ವಿವರಿಸುವ ವರ್ತನೆಯ ನಮ್ಮದೇ ಅನುಷ್ಠಾನ; ಫಲಿತಾಂಶಗಳು ಅದು ಓಡಿದ ಯಂತ್ರವನ್ನು ಅವಲಂಬಿಸಿವೆ. ಈ lesson ಈ ಸ್ಥಾನದ ಹಿಂದಿನ lesson ಅನ್ನು ಬದಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"The Cost of a Cold Start","textKn":"ಶೀತ ಆರಂಭದ ವೆಚ್ಚ","level":"H2"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Probe Once, Persist the Answers","headingKn":"ಒಮ್ಮೆ probe ಮಾಡಿ, ಉತ್ತರಗಳನ್ನು ಉಳಿಸಿ","bodyEn":"A new agent session otherwise spends its first minutes rediscovering the same facts: which Python, which packages, which test command, whether the saved state can be trusted. An initialization script checks these deterministically before the agent starts, records every result in a JSON report and exits non-zero when a blocking check fails. This part runs five probes on this machine, with satisfiable and unsatisfiable requirements, and tests the report, the exit code and repeatability.","bodyKn":"ಹೊಸ agent ಸೆಷನ್ ಇಲ್ಲದಿದ್ದರೆ ತನ್ನ ಮೊದಲ ನಿಮಿಷಗಳನ್ನು ಅದೇ ಸತ್ಯಗಳನ್ನು ಮರುಕಂಡುಹಿಡಿಯಲು ಖರ್ಚು ಮಾಡುತ್ತದೆ: ಯಾವ Python, ಯಾವ ಪ್ಯಾಕೇಜ್‌ಗಳು, ಯಾವ ಪರೀಕ್ಷಾ ಆದೇಶ, ಉಳಿಸಿದ ಸ್ಥಿತಿಯನ್ನು ನಂಬಬಹುದೇ. ಆರಂಭ ಸ್ಕ್ರಿಪ್ಟ್ agent ಆರಂಭಿಸುವ ಮುನ್ನ ಇವನ್ನು ನಿರ್ಣಾಯಕವಾಗಿ ಪರಿಶೀಲಿಸಿ, ಪ್ರತಿ ಫಲಿತಾಂಶವನ್ನು JSON ವರದಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ದಾಖಲಿಸಿ, ತಡೆಯುವ ಪರಿಶೀಲನೆ ವಿಫಲವಾದಾಗ ಶೂನ್ಯೇತರದೊಂದಿಗೆ ನಿರ್ಗಮಿಸುತ್ತದೆ. ಈ ಭಾಗ ಈ ಯಂತ್ರದಲ್ಲಿ ತೃಪ್ತಿಪಡಿಸಬಹುದಾದ ಮತ್ತು ತೃಪ್ತಿಪಡಿಸಲಾಗದ ಅವಶ್ಯಕತೆಗಳೊಂದಿಗೆ ಐದು probes ಓಡಿಸಿ ವರದಿ, exit code ಮತ್ತು ಪುನರಾವರ್ತನೀಯತೆ ಪರೀಕ್ಷಿಸುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"diagram","data":{"headingEn":"Probe, Record, Gate","headingKn":"Probe, ದಾಖಲಿಸಿ, Gate","svgCode":"<svg viewBox="0 0 300 190" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="monospace" font-size="7"><rect width="300" height="190" rx="8" fill="#0f172a"/><text x="150" y="14" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle">Five probes, one report</text><rect x="10" y="30" width="80" height="34" rx="5" fill="#022c22" stroke="#34d399"/><text x="50" y="45" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">runtime</text><text x="50" y="57" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">python, deps</text><rect x="110" y="30" width="80" height="34" rx="5" fill="#422006" stroke="#fbbf24"/><text x="150" y="45" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">commands</text><text x="150" y="57" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">env, state</text><rect x="210" y="30" width="80" height="34" rx="5" fill="#1e1b4b" stroke="#a78bfa"/><text x="250" y="45" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">report</text><text x="250" y="57" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">JSON, every result</text><rect x="80" y="110" width="140" height="34" rx="5" fill="#450a0a" stroke="#f87171"/><text x="150" y="125" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">exit code</text><text x="150" y="137" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">the actual gate</text><path d="M90,47 H110 M190,47 H210 M150,64 V110" stroke="#475569"/><text x="150" y="180" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">probe once, record, and let the exit code decide</text></svg>","captionEn":"The exit code is the gate.","captionKn":"Exit code ಯೇ gate."}},{"type":"table","data":{"headingEn":"The five probes","headingKn":"ಐದು probes","headers":["Probe","Checks","Does not prove"],"rows":[["python_version","interpreter meets the minimum","the right virtual environment is active"],["dependencies","modules are discoverable","they import and work"],["test_command","the command resolves on PATH","the tests pass"],["environment","required variables are non-empty","they hold valid values"],["state_freshness","the state file is recent","its content is valid"]]}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Building and Testing the Ideas","textKn":"ಕಲ್ಪನೆಗಳನ್ನು ನಿರ್ಮಿಸಿ ಪರೀಕ್ಷಿಸುವುದು","level":"H2"}},{"type":"code","data":{"filename":"in_1.py","headingEn":"The five probes and the report","headingKn":"ಐದು probes ಮತ್ತು ವರದಿ","descEn":"Each probe returns the same dictionary shape (name, status, detail) so the report writer treats them alike. probe_dependencies catches the exceptions find_spec can raise. probe_env reports only the names of missing variables, never values. probe_state reads the modification time and refuses a future timestamp.","descKn":"ಪ್ರತಿ probe ಒಂದೇ dictionary ಆಕಾರ (name, status, detail) ಮರಳಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ವರದಿ ಬರಹಗಾರ ಅವನ್ನು ಒಂದೇ ರೀತಿ ನಡೆಸಿಕೊಳ್ಳುತ್ತದೆ. probe_dependencies find_spec ಎತ್ತಬಹುದಾದ ಅಪವಾದಗಳನ್ನು ಹಿಡಿಯುತ್ತದೆ. probe_env ಕಾಣೆಯಾದ ವೇರಿಯಬಲ್‌ಗಳ ಹೆಸರುಗಳನ್ನು ಮಾತ್ರ ವರದಿ ಮಾಡುತ್ತದೆ, ಮೌಲ್ಯಗಳನ್ನಲ್ಲ. probe_state ಮಾರ್ಪಾಡು ಸಮಯ ಓದಿ ಭವಿಷ್ಯದ ಸಮಯಮುದ್ರೆ ತಿರಸ್ಕರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ.","code":"def result(name, status, detail):
    return {"name": name, "status": status, "detail": detail}


def probe_python(required=(3, 10)):
    actual = sys.version_info[:2]
    ok = actual >= required
    return result("python_version", "pass" if ok else "fail", f"Python {actual[0]}.{actual[1]}" + ("" if ok else f" < required {required[0]}.{required[1]}"))


def probe_dependencies(packages):
    missing = []
    for p in packages:
        try:
            spec = importlib.util.find_spec(p)
        except (ImportError, ValueError):
            spec = None
        if spec is None:
            missing.append(p)
    return result("dependencies", "fail" if missing else "pass", ("Missing: " + ", ".join(missing)) if missing else "all discoverable")


def probe_test_command(cmd):
    path = shutil.which(cmd)
    return result("test_command", "pass" if path else "fail", f"resolved {path}" if path else f"not found on PATH: {cmd}")


def probe_env(names):
    missing = [n for n in names if not os.environ.get(n)]
    return result("environment", "fail" if missing else "pass", ("Missing: " + ", ".join(missing)) if missing else "required variables present")


def probe_state(path, max_hours=24):
    path = Path(path)
    if not path.is_file():
        return result("state_freshness", "fail", f"state file not found: {path.name}")
    age = (time.time() - path.stat().st_mtime) / 3600
    if age < 0:
        return result("state_freshness", "fail", "modification time is in the future")
    if age > max_hours:
        return result("state_freshness", "fail", f"{age:.1f} h old, limit {max_hours}")
    return result("state_freshness", "pass", f"{age:.2f} h old")


def report(probes):
    fails = [p for p in probes if p["status"] == "fail"]
    return {"healthy": not fails, "failure_count": len(fails), "probes": probes}"}},{"type":"code","data":{"filename":"in_1.py","headingEn":"main(): five experiments","headingKn":"main(): ಐದು ಪ್ರಯೋಗಗಳು","descEn":"main() runs the probes with satisfiable requirements, then with impossible ones, passes the report to a real subprocess that exits 0 or 1, sets file modification times with os.utime to test freshness and runs the probes twice to compare reports.","descKn":"main() ತೃಪ್ತಿಪಡಿಸಬಹುದಾದ ಅವಶ್ಯಕತೆಗಳೊಂದಿಗೆ ಮತ್ತು ನಂತರ ಅಸಾಧ್ಯವಾದವುಗಳೊಂದಿಗೆ probes ಓಡಿಸಿ, ವರದಿಯನ್ನು 0 ಅಥವಾ 1 ನೊಂದಿಗೆ ನಿರ್ಗಮಿಸುವ ನಿಜ subprocess ಗೆ ನೀಡಿ, ತಾಜಾತನ ಪರೀಕ್ಷಿಸಲು os.utime ನೊಂದಿಗೆ ಫೈಲ್ ಮಾರ್ಪಾಡು ಸಮಯ ಹೊಂದಿಸಿ ಮತ್ತು ವರದಿಗಳನ್ನು ಹೋಲಿಸಲು probes ಎರಡು ಬಾರಿ ಓಡಿಸುತ್ತದೆ.","code":"def section(t):
    print(f"\n--- {t} ---")


def main():
    with tempfile.TemporaryDirectory() as d:
        state = Path(d) / "agent_state.json"
        state.write_text("{}", encoding="utf-8")
        os.environ["LAB_API_KEY"] = "dummy-value-not-a-secret"

        section("1. Genuinely running: all five probes on this machine with satisfiable requirements")
        probes = [probe_python((3, 8)), probe_dependencies(["json", "pathlib"]), probe_test_command("python"), probe_env(["LAB_API_KEY"]), probe_state(state)]
        for p in probes:
            print(f"{p['status'].upper():5} {p['name']:16} {p['detail'][:70]}")
        rep = report(probes)
        print("healthy:", rep["healthy"], "| failures:", rep["failure_count"])
        print("the details name what was found and never print the value of the environment variable; a pass here says the check ran against this machine today and nothing about the application")

        section("2. Genuinely running: the same probes with requirements this machine cannot meet")
        probes = [probe_python((9, 0)), probe_dependencies(["json", "no_such_package_xyz"]), probe_test_command("no-such-test-runner"), probe_env(["LAB_MISSING_VARIABLE"]), probe_state(Path(d) / "gone.json")]
        for p in probes:
            print(f"{p['status'].upper():5} {p['name']:16} {p['detail'][:70]}")
        rep = report(probes)
        print("healthy:", rep["healthy"], "| failures:", rep["failure_count"])
        print("all five failed independently and the report collected every failure instead of stopping at the first, so one run lists all five things to fix")

        section("3. Genuinely checking: the report and the exit code through a real subprocess")
        code = ("import json,sys;r=json.loads(sys.argv[1]);print('RESULT:', 'HEALTHY' if r['healthy'] else 'BLOCKED');sys.exit(0 if r['healthy'] else 1)")
        for label, r in (("healthy report", report([probe_python((3, 8))])), ("blocked report", rep)):
            p = subprocess.run([sys.executable, "-c", code, json.dumps(r)], capture_output=True, text=True)
            print(f"{label:15} printed {p.stdout.strip():16} exit code {p.returncode}")
        print("a printed BLOCKED with exit code 0 would let the agent launch anyway; the launcher acts on the exit code, so the code has to be non-zero when a blocking probe fails")

        section("4. Genuinely checking: state freshness at the edges (modification times set with os.utime)")
        for label, offset_h in (("fresh (1 h old)", 1), ("old (30 h old)", 30), ("future (+2 h)", -2)):
            t = time.time() - offset_h * 3600
            os.utime(state, (t, t))
            print(f"{label:16} {probe_state(state)}")
        os.utime(state, None)
        state.write_text("{not json", encoding="utf-8")
        print("fresh file with broken content:", probe_state(state))
        print("freshness only reads the modification time, so a file that was just written but is corrupt still passes; a content check is a separate probe")

        section("5. Genuinely measuring: idempotency, the report differs only in volatile fields")
        def run_once():
            ps = [probe_python((3, 8)), probe_dependencies(["json"]), probe_test_command("python"), probe_env(["LAB_API_KEY"]), probe_state(state)]
            r = report(ps)
            r["generated_at"] = datetime.now(timezone.utc).isoformat()
            return r
        a, b = run_once(), run_once()
        same = {k: a[k] == b[k] for k in a}
        print(same)
        print("only the timestamp differs between two runs; the checks themselves read state and change nothing, which is what makes initialization safe to repeat")"}},{"type":"output","data":{"output":"
