the report keeps the score and the finding side by side, so a builder can act on 'The original problem remains unsolved.' and a later session can see why the change was rejected; these findings are fixed strings chosen by the stub, not an analysis of any code"}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Reading the Verified Output","textKn":"ಪರಿಶೀಲಿತ Output ಓದುವುದು","level":"H2"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Genuinely Found: A Passing Gate Did Not Save the Wrong-Problem Change","headingKn":"ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಕಂಡುಬಂದದ್ದು: ಪಾಸ್ ಆದ Gate ತಪ್ಪು-ಸಮಸ್ಯೆ ಬದಲಾವಣೆಯನ್ನು ಉಳಿಸಲಿಲ್ಲ","bodyEn":"Section 1: the clean change scored 10 of 10 and passed. The wrong-problem change had a passing gate, scored 7 of 10 and was hard_fail because problem_fit was 0 (verification_quality was 1). Section 2: all twos passed with 10; a single zero with the rest at two gave hard_fail at 8; all ones (total 5) gave soft_fail; two zeros gave hard_fail at 3.","bodyKn":"ವಿಭಾಗ 1: ಸ್ವಚ್ಛ ಬದಲಾವಣೆ 10 ರಲ್ಲಿ 10 ಪಡೆದು ಪಾಸ್ ಆಯಿತು. ತಪ್ಪು-ಸಮಸ್ಯೆ ಬದಲಾವಣೆಗೆ gate ಪಾಸ್ ಆಗಿತ್ತು, 10 ರಲ್ಲಿ 7 ಪಡೆದು problem_fit 0 ಇದ್ದುದರಿಂದ hard_fail ಆಯಿತು (verification_quality 1 ಆಗಿತ್ತು). ವಿಭಾಗ 2: ಎಲ್ಲಾ ಎರಡು 10 ನೊಂದಿಗೆ ಪಾಸ್ ಆದವು; ಉಳಿದವು ಎರಡಿರುವಾಗ ಒಂದು ಸೊನ್ನೆ 8 ರಲ್ಲಿ hard_fail ನೀಡಿತು; ಎಲ್ಲಾ ಒಂದು (ಒಟ್ಟು 5) soft_fail ನೀಡಿತು; ಎರಡು ಸೊನ್ನೆ 3 ರಲ್ಲಿ hard_fail ನೀಡಿತು."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Genuinely Found: Most of the Score Space Rejects, and Booleans Are Not Scores","headingKn":"ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಕಂಡುಬಂದದ್ದು: ಅಂಕ ಸ್ಥಳದ ಹೆಚ್ಚಿನ ಭಾಗ ತಿರಸ್ಕರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಮತ್ತು Booleans ಅಂಕಗಳಲ್ಲ","bodyEn":"Section 3: of 243 combinations, 26 were pass, 6 soft_fail and 211 hard_fail. Section 4: True instead of 1, a score of 3, a score of 1.0 and a missing dimension were each rejected. Section 5: the report survived a JSON round trip with its scores and findings; the findings are fixed strings chosen by the stub and are not an analysis of code.","bodyKn":"ವಿಭಾಗ 3: 243 ಸಂಯೋಜನೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ 26 pass, 6 soft_fail ಮತ್ತು 211 hard_fail ಆದವು. ವಿಭಾಗ 4: 1 ಬದಲು True, 3 ಅಂಕ, 1.0 ಅಂಕ ಮತ್ತು ಕಾಣೆಯಾದ ಆಯಾಮ ಪ್ರತಿಯೊಂದೂ ತಿರಸ್ಕೃತವಾದವು. ವಿಭಾಗ 5: ವರದಿ ತನ್ನ ಅಂಕಗಳು ಮತ್ತು findings ಜೊತೆ JSON round trip ಉಳಿಯಿತು; findings stub ಆಯ್ದ ನಿಶ್ಚಿತ ಸ್ಟ್ರಿಂಗ್‌ಗಳು, ಕೋಡ್‌ನ ವಿಶ್ಲೇಷಣೆಯಲ್ಲ."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Why AI Uses This","headingKn":"AI ಇದನ್ನು ಏಕೆ ಬಳಸುತ್ತದೆ","bodyEn":"A reviewer that judges fit, scope and verification quality catches the change that passes every configured check and still does not do the job.","bodyKn":"ಸಮಸ್ಯೆ ಹೊಂದಾಣಿಕೆ, ವ್ಯಾಪ್ತಿ ಮತ್ತು ಪರಿಶೀಲನೆ ಗುಣಮಟ್ಟ ನಿರ್ಣಯಿಸುವ reviewer ಎಲ್ಲಾ ಸಂರಚಿತ ಪರಿಶೀಲನೆಗಳನ್ನು ಪಾಸ್ ಮಾಡಿಯೂ ಕೆಲಸ ಮಾಡದ ಬದಲಾವಣೆ ಹಿಡಿಯುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Common Misconception","headingKn":"ಸಾಮಾನ್ಯ ತಪ್ಪು ಕಲ್ಪನೆ","bodyEn":"Misconception: "a high total means a good change." A total of 8 was a hard fail because one dimension was 0.","bodyKn":"ತಪ್ಪು ಕಲ್ಪನೆ: "ಹೆಚ್ಚಿನ ಒಟ್ಟು ಎಂದರೆ ಒಳ್ಳೆಯ ಬದಲಾವಣೆ." ಒಂದು ಆಯಾಮ 0 ಆಗಿದ್ದುದರಿಂದ 8 ಒಟ್ಟು hard fail ಆಯಿತು."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Key Terms","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಮುಖ ಪದಗಳು","bodyEn":"Rubric: scored dimensions with a policy. Hard fail: a verdict forced by any zero or a low total. Soft fail: a total of 5 or 6 with no zero. Finding: the reason attached to a score. Builder and marker: separate roles.","bodyKn":"Rubric: ನೀತಿ ಇರುವ ಅಂಕ ಆಯಾಮಗಳು. Hard fail: ಯಾವುದೇ ಸೊನ್ನೆ ಅಥವಾ ಕಡಿಮೆ ಒಟ್ಟಿನಿಂದ ಬಲವಂತ ತೀರ್ಪು. Soft fail: ಸೊನ್ನೆ ಇಲ್ಲದ 5 ಅಥವಾ 6 ಒಟ್ಟು. Finding: ಅಂಕಕ್ಕೆ ಜೋಡಿಸಿದ ಕಾರಣ. Builder ಮತ್ತು marker: ಪ್ರತ್ಯೇಕ ಪಾತ್ರಗಳು."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Key Takeaways","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಮುಖ ಅಂಶಗಳು","bodyEn":"1) The wrong-problem change had a passing gate and still hard-failed. 2) One zero forced hard_fail at a total of 8. 3) 26 of 243 combinations pass. 4) A boolean is rejected as a score. 5) The report keeps scores and findings together.","bodyKn":"1) ತಪ್ಪು-ಸಮಸ್ಯೆ ಬದಲಾವಣೆಗೆ gate ಪಾಸ್ ಆಗಿದ್ದರೂ hard-fail ಆಯಿತು. 2) ಒಂದು ಸೊನ್ನೆ 8 ಒಟ್ಟಿನಲ್ಲಿ hard_fail ಬಲವಂತಗೊಳಿಸಿತು. 3) 243 ರಲ್ಲಿ 26 ಸಂಯೋಜನೆ ಪಾಸ್. 4) boolean ಅಂಕವಾಗಿ ತಿರಸ್ಕೃತ. 5) ವರದಿ ಅಂಕ ಮತ್ತು findings ಒಟ್ಟಿಗೆ ಇಡುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"quiz","data":{"questions":[{"q":"What was the total score of the wrong-problem change?","qKn":"ತಪ್ಪು-ಸಮಸ್ಯೆ ಬದಲಾವಣೆಯ ಒಟ್ಟು ಅಂಕ ಎಷ್ಟು?","opts":["7","10","3","0"],"optsKn":["7","10","3","0"],"correct":0},{"q":"How many of the 243 combinations were pass?","qKn":"243 ಸಂಯೋಜನೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಎಷ್ಟು pass?","opts":["26","211","6","243"],"optsKn":["26","211","6","243"],"correct":0},{"q":"What verdict did all ones (total 5) give?","qKn":"ಎಲ್ಲಾ ಒಂದು (ಒಟ್ಟು 5) ಯಾವ ತೀರ್ಪು ನೀಡಿತು?","opts":["soft_fail","pass","hard_fail","error"],"optsKn":["soft_fail","pass","hard_fail","ದೋಷ"],"correct":0},{"q":"Why is True rejected as a rubric score?","qKn":"True ಅನ್ನು rubric ಅಂಕವಾಗಿ ಏಕೆ ತಿರಸ್ಕರಿಸಲಾಗುತ್ತದೆ?","opts":["It is a bool, which Python would treat as 1","It is too large","JSON forbids it","It is negative"],"optsKn":["ಅದು bool, Python 1 ಎಂದು ಪರಿಗಣಿಸುತ್ತದೆ","ಅದು ತುಂಬಾ ದೊಡ್ಡದು","JSON ನಿಷೇಧಿಸುತ್ತದೆ","ಅದು ಋಣಾತ್ಮಕ"],"correct":0},{"q":"Did the passing verification gate prevent the hard fail?","qKn":"ಪಾಸ್ ಆದ ಪರಿಶೀಲನಾ gate hard fail ತಡೆಯಿತೇ?","opts":["No","Yes","Only for soft fails","Only in strict mode"],"optsKn":["ಇಲ್ಲ","ಹೌದು","soft fail ಗೆ ಮಾತ್ರ","strict ಕ್ರಮದಲ್ಲಿ ಮಾತ್ರ"],"correct":0}]}}]
